                <pb facs="0804" n="734" sameAs="frus:frus1883/pg734"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure in No. 23.—Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <p rendition="#center">Portuguese budget for 1883–1884.</p>
                <p>The budget of the ordinary expenditures of the state and metropolis for the years
                    1883–1884, with the respective receipts calculated according to the system of
                    accounts now in force.</p>
